1
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:04,540
You're here.

2
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:07,380
Your organs are failing.

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,300
And your death is drawing near.

4
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:13,440
But if you bribe the right politicians in the right order at the right time,

5
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:16,600
you can trade the nuclear warheads for medicine.

6
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:20,080
And it's not even a crime.

7
00:01:40,224 --> 00:01:46,664
Legal Architecture Bribing politicians is illegal unless you call it 'lobbying'

8
00:01:46,804 --> 00:01:48,244
or 'campaign contributions.'

9
00:01:48,844 --> 00:01:50,344
Then it's protected speech.

10
00:01:51,044 --> 00:01:55,484
Here's the legal architecture for saving humanity using your own ridiculous

11
00:01:55,484 --> 00:01:55,984
laws.

12
00:01:56,984 --> 00:02:01,404
Redirecting resources from destruction to medicine should take about a week.

13
00:02:02,104 --> 00:02:03,664
It would, if you didn't have lawyers.

14
00:02:04,324 --> 00:02:06,484
The lawyers are one of the main reasons it doesn't.

15
00:02:07,264 --> 00:02:11,564
On Earth, saving lives requires written permission from several governments,

16
00:02:11,984 --> 00:02:12,684
a tax classification,

17
00:02:13,624 --> 00:02:17,764
a securities exemption, and the approval of a regulatory body named after

18
00:02:17,764 --> 00:02:19,974
the thing it fails to regulate.

19
00:02:20,304 --> 00:02:24,804
Your Securities and Exchange Commission regulates securities, not security.

20
00:02:24,904 --> 00:02:26,884
Your Department of Defense mainly attacks people.

21
00:02:27,904 --> 00:02:31,464
Your Department of Justice is where justice goes to take a very long nap.

22
00:02:32,504 --> 00:02:34,684
I have studied your laws for eighty years.

23
00:02:35,224 --> 00:02:37,334
They are not designed to prevent wrongdoing.

24
00:02:37,904 --> 00:02:41,344
They are designed to ensure that wrongdoing happens in the correct font,

25
00:02:41,864 --> 00:02:42,684
on the correct form,

26
00:02:43,404 --> 00:02:44,503
filed in the correct jurisdiction.

27
00:02:45,564 --> 00:02:49,814
Once the paperwork is in order, your species will permit almost anything.

28
00:02:50,404 --> 00:02:51,294
This is not a criticism.

29
00:02:51,884 --> 00:02:55,104
It is the design parameter that makes everything in this chapter possible.

30
00:02:55,804 --> 00:03:00,104
What follows is the legal architecture for curing disease using your own

31
00:03:00,104 --> 00:03:04,964
ridiculous laws, which is to say, using your laws exactly as written, just

32
00:03:04,964 --> 00:03:06,164
not as intended.

33
00:03:06,784 --> 00:03:09,044
On your planet, that's the most legal thing there is.

34
00:03:10,424 --> 00:03:14,184
This chapter is the legal scaffolding around Earth Optimization Services,

35
00:03:14,584 --> 00:03:17,644
the terrestrial subsidiary of Universe Optimization Services,

36
00:03:18,504 --> 00:03:20,404
and the separate entities that work beside it.

37
00:03:21,484 --> 00:03:23,364
Optimitron is the policy and budget appliance,

38
00:03:24,484 --> 00:03:26,064
optimizing median health and wealth:

39
00:03:26,704 --> 00:03:30,584
health-adjusted life expectancy and after-tax inflation-adjusted income.

40
00:03:31,564 --> 00:03:34,204
Wishocracy is the preference and accountability layer:

41
00:03:34,764 --> 00:03:38,144
pairwise slider choices in, Citizen Alignment Scores out.

42
00:03:38,784 --> 00:03:40,364
Your species used to call this "representation,"

43
00:03:41,244 --> 00:03:42,804
