44
00:03:44,264 --> 00:03:48,584
Your laws do not allow a single entity to accept tax-deductible donations,

45
00:03:48,784 --> 00:03:52,564
lobby politicians, issue securities, and coordinate international treaties

46
00:03:52,564 --> 00:03:53,364
all at once.

47
00:03:53,884 --> 00:03:55,954
So the work is split across several separate,

48
00:03:56,564 --> 00:03:58,444
