49
00:04:00,004 --> 00:04:05,244
Earth Optimization Services is a Delaware C corp, the investment vehicle;

50
00:04:05,564 --> 00:04:10,424
the charity, the advocacy arm, the campaign-bond corporation, and the treasury

51
00:04:10,424 --> 00:04:16,304
