137
00:08:42,024 --> 00:08:42,904
Why Delaware?

138
00:08:43,444 --> 00:08:45,364
More corporations than humans live there.

139
00:08:45,924 --> 00:08:49,724
Your Supreme Court decided that companies are people who can talk, and talking

