145
00:09:06,884 --> 00:09:08,424
Entity number four:

146
00:09:08,484 --> 00:09:10,264
The Mission-Lock ("The Soul").

147
00:09:11,044 --> 00:09:14,524
This is the part that stops the whole thing from forgetting why it exists.

148
00:09:15,424 --> 00:09:19,284
Every for-profit eventually drifts toward maximizing shareholder value,

149
00:09:19,724 --> 00:09:23,824
