152
00:09:32,044 --> 00:09:36,484
The only defense is a steward with a locked charter and a very long memory.

153
00:09:37,004 --> 00:09:42,224
So the voting control of Earth Optimization Services goes, permanently and

154
00:09:42,224 --> 00:09:47,404
