166
00:10:26,824 --> 00:10:29,744
Why One Organization Pretending to Be Four.

167
00:10:30,344 --> 00:10:33,984
Each entity does only what's perfectly legal in its jurisdiction.

168
00:10:34,524 --> 00:10:37,204
Combined, they do what's impossible with a single structure.

169
00:10:38,184 --> 00:10:41,784
This is like a relay team where each runner is only allowed to run on a

170
00:10:41,784 --> 00:10:45,664
